                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "A good platformer, with gameplay like Mega Man X.\n\nPros:\n- Good graphics;\n- Precise gameplay that’s easy to get the hang of;\n- Great design, both for the characters and the environments;\n- An interesting story, albeit a short one;\n- Decent replay value (you’ll likely want to play through a few more times to earn achievements);\n- Includes trading cards and achievements.\n\nCons:\n- Short;\n- It can be difficult to get used to switching weapons on the fly.",
